          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Apache License 2.0 is a liberal license that allows users the freedom to use the software for any purpose, to distribute it, to modify it, and to distribute modified versions of the software, under the terms of the license itself. It also provides an express grant of patent rights from contributors to users."
        }
