    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Key features of this license:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-84",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Freedom of Use:** Users can use the software for any purpose without restrictions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-85",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Modification and Redistribution:** Users are free to modify the software and distribute their modified versions, ensuring that innovations can be shared and built upon."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Patent Grant:** The license explicitly grants patent rights from contributors to the users, which means that users are protected from patent claims by the contributors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Protection Against Trademark Abuse:** It does not grant trademark rights, thus protecting the integrity of the trademark owner's brand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Retention of Copyright Notices:** When users distribute the software, they must provide recipients with a copy of the license and any notices. This ensures that all recipients are aware of their rights under the license."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-89",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**State Changes:** Requires modified versions to be marked as changed, so that problems introduced by others are not attributed erroneously to the original authors."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Restrictions and limitations for Docket TV:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-92",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Liability:** The license includes a disclaimer of liability, stating that the software is provided \"as is\" without any warranties or guarantees. Users must acknowledge this disclaimer and understand that the software may not be error-free."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-93",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Trademark Use:** The license does not grant any rights to use the names, logos, or trademarks of the original authors for promotional purposes."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
