              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Patent Termination:** Rights under the MPL are terminated for a user who initiates patent litigation against a contributor related to the software."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-123",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
