    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Some dependencies used in Docket TV are governed by custom licenses that provide specific terms and conditions for their use. These licenses are designed to offer unique features or services while ensuring compliance with legal requirements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1 dependency with a custom license is used in Docket TV:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-177",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "[**planby**](https://www.npmjs.com/package/planby)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Breakdown of PLANBY \"OPEN Free\" Plan License"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Docket TV utilizes the PLANBY open source component for the TV guide schedule UI. PLANBY offers an \"OPEN Free\" plan, which is a custom license designed to provide basic functionalities without cost. This license allows Docket TV to use PLANBY's services for free, subject to certain usage limits and restrictions. Here’s a breakdown of what this means for Docket TV:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-181",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Cost-Free Basic Features**: The \"OPEN Free\" plan includes basic features that Docket TV can use without incurring direct costs. There are no fees for these features as long as usage limits specified in the terms are not exceeded."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-182",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Monetization Freedom**: Docket TV can generate revenue through its application without owing any licensing fees to PLANBY for the use of the free tier features. This allows for independent monetization while using PLANBY's services."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-183",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Intellectual Property and Customization**: Any intellectual property related to PLANBY's platform remains with PLANBY. The free license restricts extensive customization or proprietary extension of the provided features. For more advanced customization, a higher-tier plan such as PRO or Custom Enterprise may be required."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-184",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Compliance with Terms**: While using the free plan, Docket TV must adhere to all other terms and conditions associated with the plan, including usage policies and data handling practices. It’s important to review these terms to ensure compliance, especially regarding any restrictions on commercial use."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Restrictions and limitations for Docket TV:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-187",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "None"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-190",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The PLANBY \"OPEN Free\" plan license allows Docket TV to use the PLANBY component for TV guide schedule UI without incurring direct costs, subject to usage limits and restrictions. This license provides basic features for free, enabling Docket TV to integrate the TV guide schedule UI into its platform while maintaining compliance with the terms of the license. For detailed terms and conditions, the PLANBY license can be found [here](https://planby.app/docs/planby-license.pdf) for further review."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each license type listed above has been verified to ensure that it does not infringe upon our ability to claim trademarks or patents on proprietary developments or innovations specific to Docket TV. This documentation serves to clarify the legal framework within which our technology operates, safeguarding our business interests and intellectual property rights."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Understanding the open source licenses of the software packages used in Docket TV is crucial for maintaining legal compliance and protecting our intellectual property rights. By adhering to the terms of these licenses, we can ensure that our platform operates within the boundaries of the law while leveraging the benefits of open source software."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
